# ── apps/web environment ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.
# The app RUNS WITH ZERO CONFIG using public testnet defaults — these vars
# only override those defaults and enable the Tatum-powered features.

# REQUIRED for the Tatum integration (free key at https://dashboard.tatum.io).
# Server-side only — never exposed to the browser. Powers:
#   • /api/rpc   → routes ALL on-chain reads/execution through the Tatum Sui gateway
#   • /api/rates → live SUI/USD via the Tatum Data API (header price pill + bid USD)
TATUM_API_KEY=

# Tatum Sui RPC gateway the /api/rpc proxy forwards to.
TATUM_SUI_RPC_URL=https://sui-testnet.gateway.tatum.io

# ── Optional public overrides (defaults baked into useVeilConfig.ts) ──
# Deployed VEIL package (see docs/ADDRESSES.md)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VEIL_PACKAGE_ID=0x67b75f6c83a888d8736f47297c1a2e7212e8d8b8b4d1062aace46d024d22e30c
# Walrus testnet HTTP endpoints
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WALRUS_PUBLISHER_URL=https://publisher.walrus-testnet.walrus.space
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WALRUS_AGGREGATOR_URL=https://aggregator.walrus-testnet.walrus.space
# Mysten verified Seal key-server object ids (comma-separated, 2-of-2)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SEAL_KEY_SERVER_OBJECT_IDS=0x73d05d62c18d9374e3ea529e8e0ed6161da1a141a94d3f76ae3fe4e99356db75,0xf5d14a81a982144ae441cd7d64b09027f116a468bd36e7eca494f750591623c8
